      <p class="eyebrow">THE BHAGAVATA PURANA / THE YAMUNA</p>
      <h1>Poisoned waters.<br><em>A dance of restoration.</em></h1>
      <p class="tale-deck">Krishna enters Kaliya’s lake, frees the Yamuna from the serpent’s poison and joins strength to mercy.</p>
